1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 27=

4
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:40,780
(Taiji Palace)
His Majesty summons

5
00:01:41,860 --> 00:01:44,580
Meng Zaishi, Military Governor
of the Central Circuit,

6
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:47,260
Lu Yan, General of the Left Jinwu Guard,

7
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:49,540
and Wei Shu of the Censorate!

8
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:51,060
Meng Zaishi,

9
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:53,580
you are hereby appointed
Military Governor of North Jing,

10
00:01:54,020 --> 00:01:55,660
with authority over the Eastern,
Western, and Central Circuits.

11
00:01:56,060 --> 00:01:57,140
Receive the decree and give thanks.

12
00:01:58,340 --> 00:01:58,740
I

13
00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:00,260
gratefully accept, Your Majesty.

14
00:02:09,220 --> 00:02:09,660
Your Majesty,

15
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:12,100
I request permission to depart.

16
00:02:13,300 --> 00:02:13,860
No rush.

17
00:02:15,020 --> 00:02:17,100
General, you may delay your departure.

18
00:02:19,580 --> 00:02:22,060
General Lu Yan has rendered
great service in quelling the rebellion.

19
00:02:22,380 --> 00:02:24,100
You were granted the title
of Marquis of Zhongshan.

20
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:26,100
Your rank and stipend
shall be increased,

21
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:27,300
and your descendants

22
00:02:27,780 --> 00:02:29,580
shall inherit your title
for generations to come.

23
00:02:33,660 --> 00:02:35,860
Thank you for your generosity,
Your Majesty!

24
00:02:43,220 --> 00:02:43,980
General Lu...

25
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:45,100
No,

26
00:02:46,020 --> 00:02:47,140
Marquis of Zhongshan.

27
00:02:48,020 --> 00:02:50,860
You needn't toil in the army anymore.

28
00:02:51,420 --> 00:02:54,100
You can enjoy a life
of wealth and leisure.

29
00:02:58,460 --> 00:02:59,500
Your Majesty, what does this mean?

30
00:03:00,460 --> 00:03:02,940
You personally captured Yu Cheng'an.

31
00:03:03,060 --> 00:03:04,060
Yours was the greatest contribution,

32
00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:06,060
surpassing everyone else's.

33
00:03:06,660 --> 00:03:09,020
I am grateful to Heaven

34
00:03:09,580 --> 00:03:11,180
for giving Huai a new lease on life.

35
00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:12,300
Therefore,

36
00:03:13,020 --> 00:03:14,260
I shall grant a general amnesty

37
00:03:14,620 --> 00:03:16,340
and host a month of palace banquets.

38
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:19,260
Besides, the weather is cold
and the roads are slippery.

39
00:03:19,820 --> 00:03:21,500
Why not stay at the palace

40
00:03:21,540 --> 00:03:22,780
and rest a few more days, General?

41
00:03:23,140 --> 00:03:23,940
Once the celebrations are over,

42
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:25,420
you may depart.

43
00:03:28,180 --> 00:03:28,700
Your Majesty,

44
00:03:29,620 --> 00:03:30,620
your imperial wine is exquisite,

45
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:32,420
and I'd gladly stay to enjoy it.

46
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:33,900
But if I delay my return,

47
00:03:34,260 --> 00:03:35,660
I fear unrest may break out
in North Jing.

48
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:39,340
You worry too much, General.

49
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:42,500
I'll send an envoy to North Jing

50
00:03:42,780 --> 00:03:44,540
to reassure your troops.

51
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:46,180
Your Majesty may not realize,

52
00:03:46,700 --> 00:03:48,220
but the men of North Jing
are a rough lot.

53
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:50,420
I fear any envoy you send

54
00:03:51,460 --> 00:03:52,860
may not make it back alive.

55
00:03:58,980 --> 00:04:02,100
Mu Xianqing's death has already
been announced throughout the empire.

56
00:04:03,140 --> 00:04:05,140
If something were to happen
to you too, General,

57
00:04:05,860 --> 00:04:06,980
I fear North Jing

58
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:09,340
would descend into chaos again,

59
00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:10,780
just as it did when your uncle died.

60
00:04:11,380 --> 00:04:12,700
Another upheaval could follow.

61
00:04:26,580 --> 00:04:27,860
Your Majesty makes a good point.

62
00:04:30,140 --> 00:04:31,580
I'll issue written orders to my deputy.

63
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:33,660
- Tell him...
- Tell him...

64
00:04:35,860 --> 00:04:37,180
"All is well,

65
00:04:37,900 --> 00:04:39,060
and I'll return shortly."

66
00:04:41,180 --> 00:04:43,020
Then which envoy will Your Majesty send

67
00:04:44,780 --> 00:04:46,100
to die in North Jing?

68
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:54,200
(Liangyi Hall; Universe in Harmony)

69
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:04,180
North Jing is a harsh,
bitterly cold place.

70
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:05,620
Take good care of yourself

71
00:05:06,020 --> 00:05:07,340
on your journey.

72
00:05:10,660 --> 00:05:11,540
Thank you for your concern.

73
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:14,740
Your Majesty,

74
00:05:15,260 --> 00:05:16,580
in this round of rewards,

75
00:05:17,100 --> 00:05:18,780
haven't you overlooked someone?

76
00:05:37,460 --> 00:05:37,940
Your Highness.

77
00:05:47,340 --> 00:05:48,780
Once the hunt is over,
the bow is cast aside.

78
00:05:49,980 --> 00:05:50,900
Just as I expected.

79
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:52,900
But why hasn't His Majesty

80
00:05:54,500 --> 00:05:55,700
come after

81
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:56,940
Yang Si and me yet?

82
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:58,700
Yang Si aside,

83
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:01,940
you are His Majesty's son, after all.

84
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:04,820
Yu Cheng'an's downfall
is already a tremendous blessing.

85
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:06,780
Now that the rewards have been granted,

86
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:08,580
you can finally put your mind at ease.

87
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:10,180
Son...

88
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:16,020
(Virtue, Diligence, Joy, and Peace)
Let me hold the baby!

89
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:17,700
Careful, careful.

90
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:18,860
Easy.

91
00:06:43,580 --> 00:06:44,660
Cailian did your hair, didn't she?

92
00:06:47,660 --> 00:06:48,140
That girl...

93
00:06:49,820 --> 00:06:51,540
Your Highness, let me redo it for you.

94
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:56,740
Chunhua,

95
00:06:59,020 --> 00:06:59,660
tell me,

96
00:07:00,340 --> 00:07:01,340
what would you do

97
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:03,820
if you suddenly discovered
that someone closest to you

98
00:07:04,740 --> 00:07:05,620
had become unrecognizable,

99
00:07:07,460 --> 00:07:09,220
nothing like the person

100
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:11,500
you thought you knew?

101
00:07:18,420 --> 00:07:19,180
Greetings, Your Highness.

102
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:23,820
Well, Wanyao...

103
00:07:24,340 --> 00:07:25,060
Could you...

104
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:27,220
step out for now?

105
00:07:28,660 --> 00:07:29,580
I just got here,

106
00:07:30,220 --> 00:07:30,860
and you're already kicking me out?

107
00:07:32,660 --> 00:07:33,220
No, it's just...

108
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:35,980
Your personal guard has been
looking everywhere for you.

109
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:37,540
He seemed pretty anxious.

110
00:07:38,740 --> 00:07:42,180
(Myriad Blessings Gather)

111
00:07:42,780 --> 00:07:43,300
Your Highness,

112
00:07:43,980 --> 00:07:45,260
the Crown Prince just sent word.

113
00:07:45,500 --> 00:07:46,460
Meng Zaishi couldn't leave the capital.

114
00:07:46,740 --> 00:07:47,620
He was summoned back to the palace.

115
00:07:47,940 --> 00:07:49,660
Lu Yan has been made a marquis
and removed from the Jinwu Guard.

116
00:07:50,020 --> 00:07:50,460
And

117
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:52,500
Wei Shu and Yan Shang
were summoned, too.

118
00:07:58,300 --> 00:07:59,020
Take me to the palace, quickly!

119
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:06,180
If I remember correctly,

120
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:07,620
we've met twice before.

121
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:09,860
Yet your name

122
00:08:11,180 --> 00:08:13,300
keeps coming up in conversations
around me.

123
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:15,660
And every time it does,

124
00:08:15,780 --> 00:08:17,940
it leaves quite an impression.

125
00:08:18,700 --> 00:08:19,460
I'm humbled, Your Majesty.

126
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:22,460
Rise.

127
00:08:23,380 --> 00:08:24,060
Thank you, Your Majesty.

128
00:08:26,620 --> 00:08:28,620
There was even a rumor that Wanyao

129
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:31,740
brought a handsome young man
all the way back from Lingnan.

130
00:08:32,460 --> 00:08:33,460
That was you too, wasn't it?

131
00:08:34,820 --> 00:08:35,420
Yes, Your Majesty.

132
00:08:36,500 --> 00:08:37,140
It was me.

133
00:08:37,540 --> 00:08:39,340
I once personally chose you
to marry her.

134
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:41,340
You agreed without hesitation.

135
00:08:42,180 --> 00:08:43,420
But at the time,

136
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:48,020
that traitor Yu was still determined
to send her to North Jing.

137
00:08:48,540 --> 00:08:51,660
Becoming her husband would've been
like stepping into a furnace.

138
00:08:52,380 --> 00:08:54,380
You're a clever man.
Surely you knew that.

139
00:08:58,540 --> 00:08:59,700
When I look upon Princess Danyang,

140
00:09:00,540 --> 00:09:01,740
it's like gazing up at the radiant moon.

141
00:09:02,500 --> 00:09:04,020
I saw no burning coals
or blazing furnace.

142
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:06,340
I was simply overwhelmed by the honor.

143
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:11,820
And when she shot Zheng Xing dead,

144
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:13,020
you took the blame for her,

145
00:09:13,820 --> 00:09:15,700
were you overwhelmed by that honor too?

146
00:09:21,260 --> 00:09:21,580
Yes.

147
00:09:23,220 --> 00:09:24,060
I did so

148
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:26,500
to repay the Princess
for recognizing my worth.

149
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:30,020
You keep saying how honored you are,

150
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:32,260
how grateful you are
for her recognition.

151
00:09:33,620 --> 00:09:34,420
Then tell me,

152
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:37,420
in the incident at the hunting grounds,

153
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:40,100
what exactly was your role?

154
00:09:45,820 --> 00:09:47,340
- I...
- Don't try telling me

155
00:09:47,340 --> 00:09:49,580
it was all the Crown Prince
and Princess's doing.

156
00:09:50,180 --> 00:09:52,420
I've carefully examined
what happened that night.

157
00:09:54,380 --> 00:09:55,900
You were deeply involved,

158
00:09:56,180 --> 00:09:56,580
weren't you?

159
00:10:01,380 --> 00:10:03,180
Quite impressive for a farmer
from Lingnan.

160
00:10:05,660 --> 00:10:06,420
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

161
00:10:09,060 --> 00:10:11,340
You played a major role
in bringing down Yu's faction.

162
00:10:11,940 --> 00:10:12,740
What have you done wrong?

163
00:10:13,140 --> 00:10:13,580
Your Majesty,

164
00:10:15,420 --> 00:10:17,780
when I was a farmer in Lingnan,

165
00:10:18,620 --> 00:10:19,860
I was fortunate enough to glimpse
the splendor of the court.

166
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:21,940
I begged the Princess
to give me a chance,

167
00:10:22,260 --> 00:10:23,740
so I could come to Sheng'an
for the imperial examinations.

168
00:10:24,780 --> 00:10:25,700
As a scholar,

169
00:10:26,180 --> 00:10:27,460
all I wanted was to enter public service

170
00:10:27,980 --> 00:10:28,980
and put my education to good use.

171
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:31,540
But I knew my abilities were modest.

172
00:10:32,300 --> 00:10:34,100
To earn Your Majesty's
and the Princess's favor,

173
00:10:35,020 --> 00:10:36,140
I had to follow Mao Sui's example

174
00:10:37,060 --> 00:10:38,260
and do everything I could

175
00:10:38,660 --> 00:10:39,740
to show off my talents
at every opportunity.

176
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:41,700
To claim I had no desire

177
00:10:42,380 --> 00:10:44,380
for fame, fortune, glory, or recognition

178
00:10:45,380 --> 00:10:46,180
would be lying to Your Majesty.

179
00:10:47,180 --> 00:10:47,580
Therefore,

180
00:10:48,500 --> 00:10:48,860
I

181
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:49,980
admit my fault.

182
00:10:51,700 --> 00:10:52,580
Yan Shang,

183
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:54,140
you keep asking

184
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:56,740
for my forgiveness,

185
00:10:56,740 --> 00:10:57,700
but in truth,

186
00:10:58,100 --> 00:11:00,820
you're avoiding the real question.

187
00:11:02,940 --> 00:11:03,900
Come closer and answer me.

188
00:11:05,460 --> 00:11:05,820
Yes, Your Majesty.

189
00:11:13,060 --> 00:11:14,100
You know, Wanyao

190
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:16,740
is the only child of my first wife.

191
00:11:17,340 --> 00:11:19,180
She's also the daughter I cherish most.

192
00:11:19,780 --> 00:11:22,020
She's clever and strong-willed.

193
00:11:22,540 --> 00:11:23,100
Of course,

194
00:11:23,700 --> 00:11:26,500
she can be willful and spoiled at times.

195
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:28,420
But after

196
00:11:29,700 --> 00:11:31,460
she survived that monster Meng Baiyu

197
00:11:31,460 --> 00:11:32,420
and came home alive,

198
00:11:33,020 --> 00:11:35,580
then smiled so sweetly
in Yu Cheng'an's presence,

199
00:11:36,140 --> 00:11:38,540
I realized my daughter

200
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:40,340
knows how to endure

201
00:11:42,300 --> 00:11:43,500
and hide her true intentions.

202
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:54,300
Whether it was Yu Cheng'an or Wei Qiao,

203
00:11:54,660 --> 00:11:56,740
they lost to Wanyao

204
00:11:56,740 --> 00:11:58,220
for one simple reason.

205
00:11:58,220 --> 00:11:58,900
They thought

206
00:11:59,220 --> 00:12:01,300
she was just like Luling,

207
00:12:02,060 --> 00:12:04,740
interested in nothing
but pleasure and amusement.

208
00:12:05,460 --> 00:12:06,100
After all,

209
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:08,540
what can

210
00:12:09,180 --> 00:12:10,140
a woman possibly do?

211
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:12,580
Keep a few cats and dogs

212
00:12:12,580 --> 00:12:14,460
as pets to amuse herself.

213
00:12:15,460 --> 00:12:16,260
Maybe accidentally

214
00:12:17,060 --> 00:12:19,860
crush a butterfly or dragonfly.

215
00:12:20,260 --> 00:12:21,620
That's about the worst she could do.

216
00:12:22,300 --> 00:12:25,540
Back then, Luling
had Yu Cheng'an's support.

217
00:12:25,660 --> 00:12:26,980
How powerful she seemed.

218
00:12:27,980 --> 00:12:29,180
But that was all she amounted to.

219
00:12:31,860 --> 00:12:32,300
Your Majesty,

220
00:12:34,260 --> 00:12:35,740
Princess Danyang is kindhearted.

221
00:12:37,180 --> 00:12:38,940
She would never commit such cruel acts.

222
00:12:40,980 --> 00:12:43,260
You seem to know my daughter
better than I do.

223
00:12:48,180 --> 00:12:49,820
A young widow,

224
00:12:50,340 --> 00:12:52,380
with no leverage or powerful allies,

225
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:54,180
managed, in so little time,

226
00:12:54,580 --> 00:12:56,180
to form an alliance
with her half-brother,

227
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:59,300
gather devoted admirers
and wait for her chance,

228
00:12:59,580 --> 00:13:00,660
turn the tables,

229
00:13:01,340 --> 00:13:03,660
and bring Yu Cheng'an down overnight.

230
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:09,700
Luling was so arrogant back then.

231
00:13:10,220 --> 00:13:13,140
Yet all she did was secure
a few official titles

232
00:13:13,620 --> 00:13:14,940
for her male favorites,

233
00:13:15,740 --> 00:13:17,740
filling the court with a few more fools.

234
00:13:19,460 --> 00:13:21,380
But when it comes to stirring up trouble

235
00:13:22,380 --> 00:13:24,620
and turning the entire court

236
00:13:25,260 --> 00:13:26,900
upside down,

237
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:29,420
she's no match for Wanyao.

238
00:13:35,020 --> 00:13:35,540
What a shame.

239
00:13:40,900 --> 00:13:41,300
Your Majesty,

240
00:13:42,380 --> 00:13:43,500
Princess Danyang is sincere
and devoted to you.

241
00:13:44,260 --> 00:13:45,060
She kept a low profile for years,

242
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:46,780
all to help you eliminate Yu's faction.

243
00:13:47,380 --> 00:13:48,380
She even risked her own life.

244
00:13:49,660 --> 00:13:50,580
Her intentions are clear,

245
00:13:51,100 --> 00:13:52,060
and her sacrifices deserve compassion.

246
00:13:57,580 --> 00:13:58,700
Are you worried

247
00:13:59,020 --> 00:14:02,100
I'll treat her the way I treated
Meng Zaishi and Lu Yan?

248
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:12,380
Your Majesty,

249
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:16,740
the Princess

250
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:19,900
is merely a woman.

251
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:22,620
She cannot govern a fief

252
00:14:23,380 --> 00:14:24,060
or command an army.

253
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:25,700
She could never pose a threat to...

254
00:14:26,180 --> 00:14:26,540
Enough!

255
00:14:29,900 --> 00:14:31,100
Yu Cheng'an's mistake,

256
00:14:31,700 --> 00:14:32,020
I

257
00:14:32,940 --> 00:14:33,900
will not repeat it.

258
00:14:48,620 --> 00:14:49,300
Yan Shang,

259
00:14:49,740 --> 00:14:51,060
have you ever kept a parrot?

260
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:53,260
Your Majesty,

261
00:14:54,060 --> 00:14:54,460
I have not.

262
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:57,100
When you keep a parrot,

263
00:14:57,420 --> 00:15:00,300
you must regularly clip its wings.

264
00:15:02,780 --> 00:15:05,860
As a boy, I kept a white parrot.

265
00:15:07,220 --> 00:15:09,660
We spent every day together.

266
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:12,420
It would even fall asleep
in the palm of my hand.

267
00:15:13,180 --> 00:15:15,660
I taught it every word it knew.

268
00:15:17,420 --> 00:15:18,660
But it was my own fault.

269
00:15:18,980 --> 00:15:20,500
I couldn't bring myself
to clip its wings.

270
00:15:21,700 --> 00:15:22,860
Until one day,

271
00:15:23,380 --> 00:15:24,700
it escaped its cage and flew away.

272
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:27,540
No matter how often I called,
it wouldn't return.

273
00:15:29,380 --> 00:15:30,540
In a fit of rage,

274
00:15:33,260 --> 00:15:34,220
I shot it down

275
00:15:35,420 --> 00:15:36,580
with my own hands.

276
00:15:40,860 --> 00:15:41,300
What a pity.

277
00:15:43,580 --> 00:15:44,900
That bird could've

278
00:15:45,460 --> 00:15:46,660
lived a very long life.

279
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:48,420
If only

280
00:15:49,500 --> 00:15:50,580
it hadn't had those wings.

281
00:15:51,780 --> 00:15:52,660
Otherwise,

282
00:15:53,700 --> 00:15:55,460
perhaps it would still be here
with me today.

283
00:15:59,180 --> 00:16:00,380
And you, Yan Shang,

284
00:16:01,780 --> 00:16:02,940
are Wanyao's

285
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,100
pair of wings.

286
00:16:10,100 --> 00:16:10,860
Bring it here.

287
00:16:32,820 --> 00:16:33,340
Princess Danyang!

288
00:16:38,020 --> 00:16:38,700
I demand to see His Majesty!

289
00:16:39,220 --> 00:16:39,780
You can't, Your Highness.

290
00:16:40,100 --> 00:16:41,260
You must be announced first.

291
00:16:44,060 --> 00:16:44,820
On the night of the hunt,

292
00:16:45,900 --> 00:16:46,900
if we'd run into you,

293
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:48,900
disaster would've struck!

294
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:49,980
Since the traitor Yu's downfall,

295
00:16:50,540 --> 00:16:51,380
His Majesty has repeatedly ordered us

296
00:16:51,660 --> 00:16:52,340
to tighten security.

297
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:57,420
Your Highness,

298
00:16:58,060 --> 00:16:58,460
please...

299
00:16:59,500 --> 00:17:00,100
Don't.

300
00:17:14,020 --> 00:17:15,860
Though I'm grateful
for the Princess's support,

301
00:17:16,740 --> 00:17:18,460
I owe my position to Your Majesty.

302
00:17:19,420 --> 00:17:20,900
Naturally, I serve at your command.

303
00:17:21,580 --> 00:17:22,660
Everything I do and think

304
00:17:23,420 --> 00:17:24,420
is for Your Majesty's benefit.

305
00:17:25,540 --> 00:17:26,020
You say

306
00:17:26,860 --> 00:17:28,060
I'm the Princess's wings.

307
00:17:29,140 --> 00:17:30,180
I wouldn't dare claim such importance.

308
00:17:31,700 --> 00:17:33,020
But I can see

309
00:17:33,700 --> 00:17:35,980
you'd risk your life for her,

310
00:17:36,300 --> 00:17:38,060
and she's deeply in love with you.

311
00:17:39,260 --> 00:17:40,100
I'm afraid

312
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:42,260
your entanglement

313
00:17:43,580 --> 00:17:44,740
has blurred the line between duty
and love.

314
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:49,020
I wouldn't lie to Your Majesty.

315
00:17:50,380 --> 00:17:51,140
I have indeed

316
00:17:51,900 --> 00:17:52,380
secretly

317
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:54,500
fallen in love with the Princess.

318
00:17:56,140 --> 00:17:56,460
But

319
00:17:57,900 --> 00:17:58,700
she has

320
00:18:00,620 --> 00:18:02,100
rejected me herself, many times.

321
00:18:07,380 --> 00:18:08,060
I beg Your Majesty

322
00:18:09,420 --> 00:18:10,300
to forgive my recklessness

323
00:18:10,860 --> 00:18:11,340
and my

324
00:18:13,060 --> 00:18:14,060
foolish hopes.

325
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:25,100
If Your Majesty would show me mercy,

326
00:18:26,260 --> 00:18:26,820
please allow me

327
00:18:28,580 --> 00:18:29,700
to resign and return home.

328
00:18:36,300 --> 00:18:37,660
I'll never set foot in Sheng'an again.

329
00:18:39,340 --> 00:18:39,940
Nor will I...

330
00:18:51,340 --> 00:18:53,380
Nor will I ever go near
the Princess again.

331
00:19:09,380 --> 00:19:10,220
Yan Shang,

332
00:19:10,980 --> 00:19:14,300
did you know that while you were
detained at the Investigation Office,

333
00:19:15,660 --> 00:19:18,100
Wanyao was pleading for your life?

334
00:19:18,900 --> 00:19:21,420
She knelt before me, crying and begging

335
00:19:21,980 --> 00:19:23,580
for a special pardon for you.

336
00:19:24,260 --> 00:19:25,340
Since our dynasty was founded,

337
00:19:25,740 --> 00:19:26,740
only three people

338
00:19:27,340 --> 00:19:28,700
have ever received such a pardon.

339
00:19:30,620 --> 00:19:31,220
I didn't know.

340
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:32,300
So you see,

341
00:19:33,900 --> 00:19:36,300
as far as I'm concerned, you two

342
00:19:37,220 --> 00:19:38,860
are clearly in love with each other.

343
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:40,380
You'd entrust each other
with your lives.

344
00:19:42,380 --> 00:19:45,140
It's because she had your help

345
00:19:45,540 --> 00:19:46,860
that she killed Zheng Xing,

346
00:19:47,100 --> 00:19:49,100
defied Meng Zaishi,
and defeated Yu Cheng'an.

347
00:19:50,260 --> 00:19:51,660
What couldn't she accomplish
with you by her side?

348
00:20:01,860 --> 00:20:02,300
Your Majesty,

349
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:03,940
I...

350
00:20:05,540 --> 00:20:07,300
I'm merely a commoner
from the countryside.

351
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:09,180
But didn't you just

352
00:20:09,940 --> 00:20:11,180
compare yourself to Mao Sui?

353
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:14,580
You know, Mao Sui's eloquence

354
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:16,860
was mightier than an army
of a million men.

355
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:27,580
But Your Majesty,

356
00:20:28,620 --> 00:20:29,300
your daughter

357
00:20:29,940 --> 00:20:31,900
is nothing like the Crown Prince
or Meng Zaishi.

358
00:20:32,980 --> 00:20:34,580
If they commanded an army of a million,

359
00:20:35,020 --> 00:20:36,700
they'd seek absolute power.

360
00:20:37,620 --> 00:20:38,260
But Wanyao...

361
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:40,300
All she wants

362
00:20:41,860 --> 00:20:42,700
is freedom.

363
00:20:48,380 --> 00:20:50,540
A bird whose wings haven't been clipped

364
00:20:51,420 --> 00:20:52,900
must be kept in a cage.

365
00:20:54,220 --> 00:20:54,620
Yan Shang,

366
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:56,660
it's precisely because of you

367
00:20:57,060 --> 00:20:57,620
that Wanyao

368
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:00,540
is even farther

369
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:02,100
from her freedom.

370
00:21:04,140 --> 00:21:04,780
Now tell me,

371
00:21:06,300 --> 00:21:07,380
that day at the hunting grounds,

372
00:21:07,700 --> 00:21:09,260
when the two armies faced off,

373
00:21:09,620 --> 00:21:10,700
I seem to recall

374
00:21:10,940 --> 00:21:13,300
you were the first to say
I wasn't there.

375
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:14,060
Am I right?

376
00:21:15,940 --> 00:21:17,260
The Princess issued a false decree.

377
00:21:18,060 --> 00:21:19,660
Was that her own idea,

378
00:21:20,940 --> 00:21:23,260
or did you put her up to it?

379
00:22:15,220 --> 00:22:15,980
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

380
00:22:16,100 --> 00:22:16,660
Get out of my way!

381
00:22:23,260 --> 00:22:24,060
Yan Shang...

382
00:22:28,100 --> 00:22:29,460
I've doomed you.

383
00:22:32,540 --> 00:22:33,060
I...

384
00:22:55,100 --> 00:23:00,020
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

385
00:23:02,180 --> 00:23:07,540
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

386
00:23:09,620 --> 00:23:15,740
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

387
00:23:15,820 --> 00:23:21,580
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

388
00:23:23,940 --> 00:23:29,260
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

389
00:23:29,300 --> 00:23:36,060
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

390
00:23:37,500 --> 00:23:40,520
♪- Soar with the wind;
- Plunge into hellfire as one♪

391
00:23:40,520 --> 00:23:42,340
♪Burning bright as a song♪

392
00:23:42,820 --> 00:23:44,020
Yan Shang, receive the imperial decree.

393
00:23:44,460 --> 00:23:45,420
By His Majesty's personal decree:

394
00:23:46,020 --> 00:23:47,620
Yan Shang, Collator at Hongwen Hall,

395
00:23:48,140 --> 00:23:50,300
is well versed in the classics,
and skilled in practical affairs.

396
00:23:50,540 --> 00:23:51,580
I commend him highly.

397
00:23:52,180 --> 00:23:52,980
In recognition of his service,

398
00:23:53,180 --> 00:23:54,460
I hereby grant him three months' leave

399
00:23:54,660 --> 00:23:56,060
to return home and visit his family,

400
00:23:56,220 --> 00:23:57,460
as a mark of imperial favor.

401
00:23:57,820 --> 00:23:58,940
By imperial command!

402
00:23:59,900 --> 00:24:00,620
I, Yan Shang,

403
00:24:01,140 --> 00:24:02,060
gratefully accept Your Majesty's decree.

404
00:24:02,060 --> 00:24:05,820
♪I'll wait if you're there♪

405
00:24:05,820 --> 00:24:09,260
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

406
00:24:09,380 --> 00:24:12,940
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

407
00:24:12,980 --> 00:24:19,820
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

408
00:24:20,060 --> 00:24:21,940
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

409
00:24:21,940 --> 00:24:24,580
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

410
00:24:24,660 --> 00:24:27,180
♪You're the only one I need♪

411
00:24:27,220 --> 00:24:30,700
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

412
00:24:30,700 --> 00:24:34,380
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

413
00:24:34,460 --> 00:24:37,820
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

414
00:24:37,900 --> 00:24:41,300
♪My last untouched innocence♪

415
00:24:41,500 --> 00:24:44,940
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

416
00:24:45,180 --> 00:24:48,620
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

417
00:24:48,740 --> 00:24:55,660
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

418
00:24:55,820 --> 00:24:57,700
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

419
00:24:57,700 --> 00:25:00,340
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

420
00:25:00,460 --> 00:25:03,020
♪You're the only one I need♪

421
00:25:03,060 --> 00:25:06,560
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

422
00:25:06,560 --> 00:25:10,220
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

423
00:25:10,260 --> 00:25:13,660
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

424
00:25:13,700 --> 00:25:17,140
♪The wind blows past us♪

425
00:25:17,420 --> 00:25:22,140
♪- If there's still...
- Some warmth left in this world♪

426
00:25:22,780 --> 00:25:27,260
♪You're the only one I need♪

427
00:25:35,820 --> 00:25:36,580
Collator,

428
00:25:37,780 --> 00:25:39,500
how does the wine taste?

429
00:25:40,620 --> 00:25:41,780
Thank you for the drink, Your Majesty.

430
00:25:42,820 --> 00:25:43,940
It's as sweet as nectar.

431
00:25:48,260 --> 00:25:49,740
That wasn't poisoned wine.

432
00:25:49,940 --> 00:25:51,340
It was just ordinary fruit juice.

433
00:25:57,380 --> 00:25:59,500
But you drank it believing
it was poisoned.

434
00:26:00,380 --> 00:26:01,980
And you drank it without hesitation.

435
00:26:04,660 --> 00:26:08,140
I'm beginning to understand Wanyao now.

436
00:26:12,100 --> 00:26:12,540
Yan Shang,

437
00:26:14,100 --> 00:26:15,860
I've seen your resolve

438
00:26:16,940 --> 00:26:18,140
and your loyalty.

439
00:26:20,180 --> 00:26:21,220
That gives me great comfort.

440
00:26:22,700 --> 00:26:24,500
But as long as I remain her wings,

441
00:26:25,580 --> 00:26:26,100
Your Majesty,

442
00:26:27,820 --> 00:26:28,860
how can you rest easy?

443
00:26:29,540 --> 00:26:31,380
So you still deserve to die.

444
00:26:32,460 --> 00:26:33,700
Just not like this.

445
00:26:38,740 --> 00:26:39,980
Then how would you have me die?

446
00:26:41,580 --> 00:26:42,300
Go to

447
00:26:43,220 --> 00:26:44,580
Lingnan Circuit on my behalf.

448
00:26:53,300 --> 00:26:54,700
I requested leave to visit my family.

449
00:26:55,420 --> 00:26:56,300
There's no need to worry, Your Highness.

450
00:26:59,220 --> 00:27:00,180
Why are your hands so cold?

451
00:27:00,820 --> 00:27:01,420
Tell me.

452
00:27:02,060 --> 00:27:02,820
What happened?

453
00:27:04,980 --> 00:27:05,460
(Yan Shang,)

454
00:27:05,940 --> 00:27:07,420
(it's precisely because of you)

455
00:27:07,900 --> 00:27:08,460
(that Wanyao)

456
00:27:09,700 --> 00:27:10,860
(is even farther)

457
00:27:11,380 --> 00:27:12,420
(from her freedom.)

458
00:27:18,060 --> 00:27:19,140
I'm just going home.

459
00:27:21,580 --> 00:27:22,940
Meng Zaishi has been placed
under house arrest.

460
00:27:23,340 --> 00:27:24,020
I thought

461
00:27:24,420 --> 00:27:24,740
you...

462
00:27:27,060 --> 00:27:27,580
I'm fine.

463
00:27:28,140 --> 00:27:29,100
Then why are you going to Lingnan?

464
00:27:31,100 --> 00:27:31,780
To go home

465
00:27:32,220 --> 00:27:32,900
and see my father,

466
00:27:33,660 --> 00:27:34,740
Xiaozhou, and my elder brother.

467
00:27:35,660 --> 00:27:36,340
His Majesty has shown me kindness.

468
00:27:37,140 --> 00:27:37,860
I'm very happy.

469
00:27:38,340 --> 00:27:39,340
He's forcing you to go.

470
00:27:42,580 --> 00:27:43,700
I'm going of my own free will.

471
00:27:48,500 --> 00:27:48,900
Oh, and...

472
00:27:50,180 --> 00:27:51,460
The bamboo at my house...

473
00:27:52,380 --> 00:27:53,820
Please take good care of it for me.

474
00:27:54,260 --> 00:27:54,700
And

475
00:27:55,420 --> 00:27:57,020
please leave the swallow's nest alone.

476
00:27:57,580 --> 00:27:58,780
The swallows will return in spring.

477
00:27:59,060 --> 00:28:00,820
And you should be back by then.

478
00:28:05,940 --> 00:28:06,860
Come on. Come home with me.

479
00:28:07,100 --> 00:28:08,100
I'll help you pack.

480
00:28:08,300 --> 00:28:08,940
That won't be necessary.

481
00:28:13,860 --> 00:28:15,020
I'll have someone

482
00:28:15,820 --> 00:28:16,660
make the arrangements for him.

483
00:28:26,900 --> 00:28:28,660
I thank Your Majesty
for your generosity.

484
00:28:29,460 --> 00:28:31,020
The Princess thinks highly of you.

485
00:28:32,340 --> 00:28:34,740
I'm merely showing favor
to someone she cares for.

486
00:28:43,620 --> 00:28:45,060
Father, if you're so considerate
of those I care for,

487
00:28:46,020 --> 00:28:46,980
why won't you let me

488
00:28:47,500 --> 00:28:49,020
take Yan Shang home to rest for a while?

489
00:28:49,300 --> 00:28:50,140
Because

490
00:28:51,260 --> 00:28:53,220
I have other plans for you.

491
00:28:54,660 --> 00:28:56,900
Starting today,
you'll stay at Lizheng Hall

492
00:28:57,220 --> 00:28:59,260
and copy Buddhist scriptures
to pray for your late mother.

493
00:29:00,940 --> 00:29:02,420
So I can't leave
without imperial permission?

494
00:29:02,900 --> 00:29:03,380
Your Majesty,

495
00:29:04,260 --> 00:29:05,540
why must you confine the Princess?

496
00:29:07,780 --> 00:29:08,660
Wanyao,

497
00:29:09,500 --> 00:29:10,660
when your mother was alive,

498
00:29:10,780 --> 00:29:12,020
her favorite scripture

499
00:29:12,420 --> 00:29:13,740
was the Lotus Sutra.

500
00:29:14,100 --> 00:29:15,700
Copy the sutra in her memory,

501
00:29:16,460 --> 00:29:17,820
to bring peace to her soul

502
00:29:18,500 --> 00:29:20,300
and pray for her blessings
and absolution.

503
00:29:20,740 --> 00:29:21,860
The Lotus Sutra has a hundred
thousand characters.

504
00:29:22,900 --> 00:29:24,380
It'll take at least a hundred days
to copy.

505
00:29:24,820 --> 00:29:27,260
So, Yan Shang, you may return home
without worry.

506
00:29:27,780 --> 00:29:29,020
By the time you return,

507
00:29:29,540 --> 00:29:30,540
I'm sure the Princess

508
00:29:31,140 --> 00:29:31,980
will have finished copying it.

509
00:29:45,780 --> 00:29:46,540
Father, since you've given your orders,

510
00:29:47,980 --> 00:29:48,940
I dare not disobey.

511
00:29:52,900 --> 00:29:53,300
Let's go.

512
00:30:46,420 --> 00:30:47,540
It's a long journey ahead.

513
00:30:48,020 --> 00:30:49,060
I let my emotions get the better of me.

514
00:30:49,940 --> 00:30:50,860
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

515
00:30:57,100 --> 00:30:58,140
You're forgiven.

516
00:31:02,900 --> 00:31:03,260
Wanyao?

517
00:31:14,060 --> 00:31:18,900
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing
across your brow♪

518
00:31:21,100 --> 00:31:26,420
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

519
00:31:26,660 --> 00:31:30,620
♪- Together we'll soar to the skies;
- Together we'll turn to ashes♪

520
00:31:30,620 --> 00:31:36,480
♪- Burning bright as a song;
- Two shadows entwined, a beautiful sight♪

521
00:31:36,580 --> 00:31:41,500
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

522
00:31:41,660 --> 00:31:46,380
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

523
00:31:46,420 --> 00:31:48,260
♪Not a single hour less♪

524
00:31:48,300 --> 00:31:52,220
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

525
00:31:52,220 --> 00:31:56,060
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

526
00:31:56,140 --> 00:31:59,500
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

527
00:31:59,660 --> 00:32:03,140
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

528
00:32:03,340 --> 00:32:10,220
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

529
00:32:10,420 --> 00:32:12,300
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

530
00:32:12,300 --> 00:32:14,940
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

531
00:32:14,980 --> 00:32:17,540
♪You're the only one I need♪
(Lizheng Hall)

532
00:32:17,580 --> 00:32:22,500
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

533
00:32:22,500 --> 00:32:24,020
Princess Danyang, please go inside.

534
00:32:24,780 --> 00:32:28,180
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

535
00:32:28,260 --> 00:32:31,660
♪My last untouched innocence♪

536
00:32:31,980 --> 00:32:35,420
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

537
00:32:35,660 --> 00:32:39,100
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

538
00:32:39,260 --> 00:32:46,140
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

539
00:32:46,300 --> 00:32:48,180
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

540
00:32:48,180 --> 00:32:50,820
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

541
00:32:50,940 --> 00:32:53,500
♪You're the only one I need♪

542
00:32:53,540 --> 00:32:57,160
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

543
00:32:57,160 --> 00:33:00,700
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

544
00:33:00,740 --> 00:33:04,140
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

545
00:33:04,700 --> 00:33:05,220
Mr. Liu,

546
00:33:05,700 --> 00:33:08,180
we've securely packed all the gifts
for Mr. Yan.

547
00:33:19,540 --> 00:33:19,980
Yan Shang,

548
00:33:21,140 --> 00:33:21,980
I really envy you.

549
00:33:23,500 --> 00:33:24,340
Look how far you've come.

550
00:33:25,500 --> 00:33:26,340
You passed the imperial examinations,

551
00:33:27,140 --> 00:33:27,940
rose through the ranks,

552
00:33:28,740 --> 00:33:29,460
received imperial honors,

553
00:33:30,500 --> 00:33:31,260
and now you're returning home in glory.

554
00:33:32,940 --> 00:33:34,660
There was a time when I thought

555
00:33:35,300 --> 00:33:36,420
coming to Sheng'an

556
00:33:37,820 --> 00:33:39,060
would set me on the same path.

557
00:33:48,220 --> 00:33:48,660
(Wenji,)

558
00:33:50,100 --> 00:33:50,940
(if only you knew.)

559
00:33:52,340 --> 00:33:53,500
(These are all gifts from His Majesty)

560
00:33:54,460 --> 00:33:55,540
(to accompany me to my grave.)

561
00:33:59,860 --> 00:34:00,740
When you return to Lingnan,

562
00:34:01,340 --> 00:34:02,020
if you have time,

563
00:34:02,620 --> 00:34:03,660
please, on my behalf...

564
00:34:12,100 --> 00:34:12,980
Please, on my behalf...

565
00:34:17,860 --> 00:34:18,420
Mr. Liu,

566
00:34:19,020 --> 00:34:20,780
when will you return to the palace
to report back?

567
00:34:26,780 --> 00:34:27,940
You needn't say another word.

568
00:34:29,060 --> 00:34:29,700
I understand.

569
00:34:43,660 --> 00:34:48,380
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

570
00:34:48,740 --> 00:34:52,820
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

571
00:34:53,020 --> 00:34:57,980
♪Dusk falls on the horizon,
sorrow and joy stretch far♪

572
00:34:58,380 --> 00:35:02,220
♪A lone lamp keeps me company♪

573
00:35:02,900 --> 00:35:07,740
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

574
00:35:08,020 --> 00:35:11,580
♪I'll take the open road
and journey home♪

575
00:35:12,540 --> 00:35:17,260
♪With rosy clouds,
I bid the moon goodnight♪

576
00:35:17,900 --> 00:35:21,900
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

577
00:35:30,100 --> 00:35:30,940
Will these plum blossoms

578
00:35:32,260 --> 00:35:33,420
still be blooming in April?

579
00:35:41,420 --> 00:35:42,900
When I left for North Jing that year,

580
00:35:44,180 --> 00:35:45,020
the blossoms had already faded.

581
00:35:47,300 --> 00:35:47,900
Back then,

582
00:35:50,020 --> 00:35:51,820
Mother was confined to this very palace.

583
00:35:53,100 --> 00:35:54,580
Such beautiful plum blossoms...

584
00:35:58,260 --> 00:35:59,460
Mother never got to see them.

585
00:36:09,620 --> 00:36:10,860
If Chunhua were still here,

586
00:36:12,940 --> 00:36:13,580
she'd be

587
00:36:16,580 --> 00:36:18,380
fussing over me and shutting
the window by now.

588
00:36:19,660 --> 00:36:20,820
You're already feeling troubled,
Your Highness.

589
00:36:21,620 --> 00:36:22,820
You really shouldn't sit
in the cold wind.

590
00:36:30,340 --> 00:36:31,380
Try not to dwell on it.

591
00:36:31,980 --> 00:36:34,300
The sooner you finish copying the sutra,
the sooner you can leave.

592
00:36:34,820 --> 00:36:35,620
I'll prepare some ink for you.

593
00:36:46,820 --> 00:36:47,780
This palace hall...

594
00:36:49,820 --> 00:36:50,740
This imperial city...

595
00:36:52,700 --> 00:36:53,900
This entire realm of Huai...

596
00:36:56,100 --> 00:36:57,260
Where could I possibly go?

597
00:37:01,380 --> 00:37:02,740
I could bring down Yu Cheng'an,

598
00:37:05,100 --> 00:37:06,660
but I could never bring him down.

599
00:37:08,820 --> 00:37:09,420
In fact,

600
00:37:11,460 --> 00:37:13,100
I could never even bring myself
to act against him.

601
00:37:16,940 --> 00:37:18,100
I'll always have to

602
00:37:18,860 --> 00:37:19,700
live under his authority,

603
00:37:20,460 --> 00:37:21,340
letting him

604
00:37:22,940 --> 00:37:24,420
decide whether we're free

605
00:37:25,620 --> 00:37:26,340
and whether we live or die.

606
00:37:41,420 --> 00:37:43,340
This was the last place Mother
ever stayed.

607
00:37:45,660 --> 00:37:46,140
Cailian!

608
00:37:48,460 --> 00:37:48,860
Yes, Your Highness?

609
00:37:49,580 --> 00:37:50,220
Help me look around.

610
00:37:50,780 --> 00:37:52,660
See if anything from three years ago
is still here.

611
00:37:53,180 --> 00:37:53,620
Yes, Your Highness.

612
00:38:04,700 --> 00:38:05,660
Is that Yan Shang's carriage?

613
00:38:10,300 --> 00:38:10,740
Wei Shu?

614
00:38:20,220 --> 00:38:21,260
So it seems

615
00:38:22,340 --> 00:38:23,260
you and I

616
00:38:24,060 --> 00:38:25,220
will be heading to opposite ends
of the country.

617
00:38:26,460 --> 00:38:27,460
Who knows

618
00:38:28,260 --> 00:38:29,340
when we'll meet again?

619
00:38:31,980 --> 00:38:33,500
Our hometowns are thousands
of miles apart,

620
00:38:34,740 --> 00:38:36,860
yet we still managed to meet
in a city as vast as Sheng'an.

621
00:38:38,300 --> 00:38:39,460
As for where fate might lead us,

622
00:38:42,380 --> 00:38:43,340
who knows?

623
00:38:47,820 --> 00:38:48,460
It's just...

624
00:38:50,300 --> 00:38:51,820
I thought after everything
that happened,

625
00:38:52,860 --> 00:38:54,540
His Majesty might reward your service

626
00:38:55,220 --> 00:38:56,100
by arranging a marriage

627
00:38:56,780 --> 00:38:57,700
between you and Princess Danyang.

628
00:39:06,340 --> 00:39:06,740
Wei Shu.

629
00:39:10,940 --> 00:39:11,300
Yan Shang.

630
00:39:29,940 --> 00:39:30,820
Where I'm going

631
00:39:31,780 --> 00:39:32,460
is very warm.

632
00:39:34,860 --> 00:39:35,260
Wei Shu.

633
00:39:44,780 --> 00:39:45,220
Take care.

634
00:40:03,580 --> 00:40:04,020
You too.

635
00:40:11,420 --> 00:40:12,180
Everything is here.

636
00:40:13,020 --> 00:40:15,380
I heard there used to be some books,
calligraphy, and paintings

637
00:40:15,700 --> 00:40:16,460
that Her Majesty kept

638
00:40:16,460 --> 00:40:18,580
to pass the time during her months
of recovery here.

639
00:40:19,380 --> 00:40:20,100
But

640
00:40:20,740 --> 00:40:22,100
after Her Majesty passed away,

641
00:40:22,580 --> 00:40:23,700
His Majesty ordered

642
00:40:24,180 --> 00:40:25,420
that they all be burned
as offerings to her.

643
00:41:09,860 --> 00:41:10,300
Cailian,

644
00:41:11,540 --> 00:41:12,500
I'd like to be alone for a while.

645
00:41:13,380 --> 00:41:13,780
Yes, Your Highness.

646
00:41:24,820 --> 00:41:25,420
(Wanyao,)

647
00:41:27,060 --> 00:41:28,780
(my heart aches for you,
still in the bloom of youth,)

648
00:41:30,060 --> 00:41:31,700
(yet so determined
to serve your country.)

649
00:41:33,900 --> 00:41:35,060
(That a princess must shed blood
and tears)

650
00:41:35,700 --> 00:41:36,820
(to safeguard the realm)

651
00:41:38,620 --> 00:41:40,500
(is a failure on the part
of your father and mother.)

652
00:41:43,620 --> 00:41:44,900
(Confined within these walls,)

653
00:41:46,300 --> 00:41:47,500
(I am powerless to help you.)

654
00:41:49,100 --> 00:41:50,420
(The pain tears at my heart.)

655
00:41:52,980 --> 00:41:55,100
(As you embark
upon this perilous journey,)

656
00:41:56,580 --> 00:41:58,300
(may your resolve remain
as strong as iron and stone,)

657
00:41:59,580 --> 00:42:00,660
(unbroken by a hundred trials,)

658
00:42:02,060 --> 00:42:03,340
(and never be shaken.)

659
00:42:06,220 --> 00:42:07,020
(My child,)

660
00:42:07,980 --> 00:42:10,220
(now that you have left
these palace walls far behind,)

661
00:42:11,980 --> 00:42:14,340
(I too must do what must be done.)

662
00:42:16,300 --> 00:42:17,820
(As long as I draw breath,)

663
00:42:19,620 --> 00:42:21,260
(I shall remain unyielding,
even in the face of death,)

664
00:42:22,980 --> 00:42:24,580
(with neither regret nor remorse.)

665
00:42:39,420 --> 00:42:42,780
(Written by Your Mother)

666
00:43:27,020 --> 00:43:28,100
How much farther to Baqiao?

667
00:43:30,420 --> 00:43:32,260
You must've been lost in thought, sir.

668
00:43:32,860 --> 00:43:33,980
We passed it long ago.

669
00:43:34,180 --> 00:43:35,260
We're almost at Lantian.

670
00:43:40,700 --> 00:43:41,300
(Yan Shang,)

671
00:43:42,300 --> 00:43:43,260
(have you really thought this through?)

672
00:43:44,100 --> 00:43:45,940
(Sheng'an is no easy place to survive.)

673
00:43:47,140 --> 00:43:48,180
(Every ruthless predator)

674
00:43:48,380 --> 00:43:50,460
(in Huai is gathered there.)

675
00:43:51,140 --> 00:43:52,380
(Whatever you compete in,
be it intelligence,)

676
00:43:52,740 --> 00:43:53,500
(scheming,)

677
00:43:53,820 --> 00:43:54,580
(flattery,)

678
00:43:55,060 --> 00:43:55,740
(or influence,)

679
00:43:56,420 --> 00:43:57,620
(someone will always
be better than you.)

680
00:43:58,700 --> 00:43:59,660
(Every day,)

681
00:44:00,060 --> 00:44:00,900
(every moment,)

682
00:44:01,740 --> 00:44:03,140
(they fight viciously for power.)

683
00:44:09,340 --> 00:44:10,100
(And you...)

684
00:44:10,660 --> 00:44:12,180
(Don't think that just
because you're clever,)

685
00:44:12,860 --> 00:44:15,420
(you'll make a name for yourself
at the Imperial Academy.)

686
00:44:15,980 --> 00:44:17,420
(I grew up in Sheng'an.)

687
00:44:18,020 --> 00:44:20,940
(I've seen countless brilliant,
gifted people)

688
00:44:21,220 --> 00:44:22,100
(go unrecognized)

689
00:44:22,540 --> 00:44:23,300
(and spend their lives in obscurity.)

690
00:44:28,220 --> 00:44:28,660
Yan Shang,

691
00:44:29,220 --> 00:44:30,100
if you dare repeat

692
00:44:31,260 --> 00:44:32,780
a word of what I said today
to anyone else,

693
00:44:33,500 --> 00:44:35,180
I'll skin you alive!

694
00:44:35,660 --> 00:44:36,220
I promise

695
00:44:36,660 --> 00:44:37,500
I won't tell a soul.

696
00:44:44,580 --> 00:44:45,340
Forgive me, sir.

697
00:44:46,020 --> 00:44:47,380
Are you all right?

698
00:45:15,060 --> 00:45:19,820
(Next Episode Preview)

699
00:45:20,020 --> 00:45:20,940
We're like

700
00:45:22,100 --> 00:45:23,980
lambs to the slaughter.

701
00:45:24,540 --> 00:45:25,860
Going to Lingnan is a suicidal move

702
00:45:26,300 --> 00:45:27,740
for Yan Shang.

703
00:45:28,300 --> 00:45:30,780
Xun, you indeed know more than I do.

704
00:45:31,300 --> 00:45:32,180
What's really going on

705
00:45:32,980 --> 00:45:34,060
in Lingnan?

706
00:45:36,401 --> 00:45:39,694
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

707
00:45:42,379 --> 00:45:47,295
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

708
00:45:49,489 --> 00:45:55,334
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

709
00:45:55,834 --> 00:46:01,060
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

710
00:46:03,829 --> 00:46:08,620
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

711
00:46:09,456 --> 00:46:15,535
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

712
00:46:17,336 --> 00:46:20,486
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

713
00:46:20,486 --> 00:46:22,134
♪Burning bright as a song♪

714
00:46:22,186 --> 00:46:25,910
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

715
00:46:26,288 --> 00:46:30,954
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

716
00:46:31,573 --> 00:46:35,614
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

717
00:46:36,105 --> 00:46:38,220
♪Not a single hour less♪

718
00:46:38,260 --> 00:46:45,206
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

719
00:46:45,969 --> 00:46:49,422
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

720
00:46:49,602 --> 00:46:52,747
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

721
00:46:53,186 --> 00:46:59,823
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

722
00:47:00,220 --> 00:47:02,258
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

723
00:47:02,258 --> 00:47:04,734
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

724
00:47:04,772 --> 00:47:07,241
♪You're the only one I need♪

725
00:47:07,445 --> 00:47:14,332
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

726
00:47:14,644 --> 00:47:17,915
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

727
00:47:18,220 --> 00:47:21,393
♪My last untouched innocence♪

728
00:47:21,717 --> 00:47:25,143
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

729
00:47:25,376 --> 00:47:28,601
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

730
00:47:28,932 --> 00:47:35,728
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

731
00:47:36,097 --> 00:47:38,159
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

732
00:47:38,160 --> 00:47:40,663
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

733
00:47:40,710 --> 00:47:43,048
♪You're the only one I need♪

734
00:47:43,279 --> 00:47:50,114
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

735
00:47:50,463 --> 00:47:52,081
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

736
00:47:52,211 --> 00:47:54,007
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

737
00:47:54,364 --> 00:47:57,381
♪You're the only one I need♪

738
00:47:57,421 --> 00:47:58,748
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

